==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|safna}}, from {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|safna}}, a by-form of {{m|non|samna||to collect, assemble}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*samnōną||to gather, collect}}. More at {{l|en|sam}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/sapn/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|apn|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|n|safns|söfn}}

# {{lb|is|institution}} a [[museum]]
# a [[collection]]
# a [[flock]] of [[sheep]]{{jump|is|flock of sheep|s}}

